    <h2>3. Break-Even Metric: International Gateway Module</h2>
    <p>A focused break-even evaluation was modeled for the integrated cross-border gateway feature[cite: 1]:</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li><strong>Gateway Fixed Cost (F):</strong> $50,000 for compliance, API setup, and gateway licensing[cite: 1].</li>
      <li><strong>Variable Expense per Tx (V):</strong> $3 per transaction in partner processing network costs[cite: 1].</li>
      <li><strong>Service Fee Revenue per Tx (P):</strong> $5 per transaction consumer gateway fee[cite: 1].</li>
      <li><strong>Break-Even Volume:</strong> $BEPu = \frac{F}{P - V} = \frac{50,000}{5 - 3} =$ <strong>25,000 transactions</strong>[cite: 1].</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 10px;">Processing just 25,000 cross-border transfers across bKash's 70-million-user ecosystem completely recoups the gateway setup investment, proving strong financial viability[cite: 1].</p>

